        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Friso, Alexander the Great\n- Places: Sabah, Frisia\n- Topics: manuscript tradition, Frisian colonization legends, historical chronology\n\nFacts:\n- A manuscript in a language spoken between the 8th and 16th centuries states that Friso was a leader of Frisian colonists.\n- The manuscript claims that the Frisian colonists had been settled in Sabah for well over a millennium before Alexander the Great discovered them.\n- The claim places Friso and the Frisian colonists in a legendary or chronologically problematic historical narrative.",
